        },
        {
          "page": 6,
          "title": "6774",
          "review_excerpt": "6774\nSample efﬁciency We explore how many train-\ning examples are needed to achieve good passage\nretrieval performance. Figure 1 illustrates the top-k\nretrieval accuracy with respect to different num-\nbers of training examples, measured on ",
          "note": "verbatim excerpt only; no generated summary"
        },
        {
